(RECITALS) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(WHEREAS, Client desires to retain Service Provider to perform enterprise software) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(development and cloud integration services; and) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(WHEREAS, Service Provider possesses the technical expertise, personnel, and resources) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(required to perform such services;) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the mutual covenants and promises herein) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(contained, the Parties agree as follows:) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(1. SCOPE OF SERVICES AND DELIVERABLES) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(1.1 Statements of Work. Service Provider shall provide the professional cloud) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(architecture, backend development, and cybersecurity integration services described) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(in one or more Statements of Work \("SOW"\) executed by both Parties.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(1.2 Standard of Performance. Service Provider covenants that all deliverables and) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(services shall be performed in a timely, professional, and workmanlike manner in) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(conformity with industry standards.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(1.3 Change Orders. Any material modification or expansion to the agreed scope of work) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(must be documented in a written Change Order signed by authorized representatives of) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(both Parties.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(2. FEES, INVOICING, AND PAYMENT TERMS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(2.1 Compensation. Client shall pay Service Provider the milestone fees and) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(time-and-materials rates set forth in each applicable SOW.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(2.2 Invoicing Schedule. Service Provider shall invoice Client on the first business) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(day of each calendar month for services rendered during the preceding month.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(2.3 Payment Terms. Client shall pay all undisputed invoice amounts within thirty \(30\)) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(calendar days from receipt of invoice \("Net 30"\).) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(2.4 Late Payment Interest. Any undisputed amount not paid when due shall accrue late) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(interest at the rate of 1.5% per month, or the maximum rate permitted by law,) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(calculated daily from the due date until paid in full.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(2.5 Disputed Invoices. Client shall notify Service Provider in writing within ten) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(\(10\) business days of invoice receipt if Client disputes any charge in good faith.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Undisputed portions must be paid on schedule.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(3. TERM AND TERMINATION) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(3.1 Term. This Agreement shall commence on the Effective Date and remain in full) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(force for an initial term of two \(2\) years, unless terminated earlier pursuant to) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(this Section 3.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(3.2 Termination for Convenience. Client or Service Provider may terminate this) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Agreement or any SOW for any reason or no reason upon providing sixty \(60\) days) '
