/F1 8.5 Tf
(liabilities, losses, or legal costs arising out of any allegation that the) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Deliverables infringe any valid patent, copyright, or trade secret.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(6.2 Client Indemnity. Client shall defend, indemnify, and hold harmless Service) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Provider against third-party claims arising from: \(a\) Client's breach of applicable) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(laws; or \(b\) data, content, or materials provided by Client to Service Provider.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(6.3 Indemnification Procedure. The indemnified Party must give prompt written notice) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(of the claim, grant the indemnifying Party sole control of defense and settlement,) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(and provide reasonable assistance at the indemnifying Party's expense.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
